    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is &quot;Love Starts Again&quot;?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live-action romance adventure with high-definition images that unfold from the protagonist's perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you become the protagonist and make choices to change the future, you will become embroiled in dramatic romances with the heroines. A realistic romance simulation filled with situations that everyone dreams of experiencing at least once.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story of carving out the future with six heroines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is Tokyo. Working at a black company.<br>One day, he collapses from overwork.<br>When he wakes up, he's in the room he lived in in the past.<br>As he tries to change the future,<br>he gets caught up in a dramatic love affair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Azusa: #Friend #Cheerful #Honest #ESFJ<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras/b87117e2ee8b0155df6c451f01b8a2ba.avif?t=1755738378\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kasumi: #Childhood friend #Unrequited love #Jealousy #ENFP<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras/fc5fbc30bfb04ef2f247f3e267e6f7b1.avif?t=1755738378\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuki: #Junior #Lady #Innocent #INTP<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras/yuki.png?t=1755738378\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai: #Senior #Part-time job #Trust #ISFP<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras/5928d0af3cd9dd3f6bbdca477b5eb608.avif?t=1755738378\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chitose: #Favourite #Influencer #Cunning #ESFP<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras/chitose.png?t=1755738378\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miku: #??? #Mysterious woman #Shy #INFJ<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707370/extras/0c2a107c09c0962755e615f78fbb7c67.avif?t=1755738378\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6A real love adventure in 4K from the protagonist's point of view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All scenes were shot in 4K from the protagonist's point of view.<br>It has a sense of speed like a short drama, but also contains memorable scenes. Here is a real love experience in Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Various choices and multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Shakespeare's work states, &quot;Life is a series of choices,&quot; you will be forced to make choices that seem like everyday choices. A single response can change the future...<br>Not only that, but a variety of choices will unfold that can lead to humor, seriousness, horror, suspense, and mysterious endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6A thorough commitment to realism</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scenario that seems like it could happen on the edge of reality, where everyone has thought, &quot;I want to go back to those days...&quot; and fantasies. Communication through chat and short videos. We've stuck to realism to create a sense of immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you see the ending with the heroine, you will surely think: <br>&quot;Love starts again.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
